[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20883.99, "timestamp": "05:48:03", "text": "そのため、彼女はますます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20888.868, "timestamp": "05:48:08", "text": "物とか全部、ええ、そうですね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20891.11, "timestamp": "05:48:11", "text": "エイプリルは本当に優しい女の子だった、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20892.148, "timestamp": "05:48:12", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "one day the townsfolk were like, lets play a lil prank on her"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20894.948, "timestamp": "05:48:14", "text": "何か、もしくは電話、うん"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20903.39, "timestamp": "05:48:23", "text": "何か何？あ、待って、待って、私の話"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20905.07, "timestamp": "05:48:25", "text": "そしてあなたの話は似たようなものだ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20906.528, "timestamp": "05:48:26", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "owo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20907.868, "timestamp": "05:48:27", "text": "でも全然違うよ、だから人々は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20911.132, "timestamp": "05:48:31", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🧐🤔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20912.468, "timestamp": "05:48:32", "text": "オーケーをクランクした彼女はオーケー"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20915.534, "timestamp": "05:48:35", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so they went upto her husband, who was taking care of their daughter "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20915.67, "timestamp": "05:48:35", "text": "ああ、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20917.91, "timestamp": "05:48:37", "text": "4月といえば、ご存知の通りいたずらで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20921.27, "timestamp": "05:48:41", "text": "町の人々は彼女をエイプリルと呼んだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20925.23, "timestamp": "05:48:45", "text": "バカども、いや、彼女はいたずらをしたので、彼女は大きなことをした"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20926.373, "timestamp": "05:48:46", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and they were asking if he could join em on the prank"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20927.67, "timestamp": "05:48:47", "text": "重大ないたずらで死んでしまったか何か"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20936.563, "timestamp": "05:48:56", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "what"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20937.75, "timestamp": "05:48:57", "text": "バカどもは私の話みたいなのが好きなんだ"}]